{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And Aaron shall lean.</b> Plene with a vav, and it is not explained why. And further it is difficult for me, for here it is written וסמכו and in the first one of the bull and the last one of the ram it is written only וסמך — unless you say that here Aaron and his sons leaned together, and in the others Aaron first and afterward his sons. And if you ask that in all of them they lean together, one may say: we remove and add and expound. That is, we remove the vav of אהרן and add it to וסמך — thus in all of them it is וסמכו. And it appears that the midrash wrote אהרן plene for this purpose. And in this manner we say in Sanhedrin regarding ולטוטפות, that we remove the vav of ולטוטפות and add it to לטטפת, and it becomes לטטפות. Thus it appears to explain."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:04:16.502550496Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}